# Killmonger, Scourge of Wakanda: when he enters Bot1 may sacrifice another creature (never himself), and when it does destroys target
# nonland permanent an opponent controls; as long as two or more creature cards are in Bot1's graveyard he gets +2/+1. Turn 3: Bot1
# sacrifices Memnite#1 (one creature card in the graveyard: still 3/3) to destroy Bot2's Agents of HYDRA, and Bot2's Lightning Bolt then
# kills the other Memnite on turn 4 (two creature cards: 5/4).

